@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health
GET {{host}}/

### 2. List assignments
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Create a submission (capture its id from the response)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200499",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200499-hue/CNTTK23D"
}

### 4. Read the newly created submission
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.id}}

### 5. Invalid submission: required fields are missing
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. Unknown assignment
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200499",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/submission"
}

### 7. Closed assignment
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/2/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200499",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/submission"
}

### 8. Unknown submission
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 9. SignalR negotiate for the submission hub
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 10. Deliberately incorrect hub route
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 11. PingSignalR hub negotiate (start PingSignalR separately on port 5200)
POST http://localhost:5200/hubs/ping/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
